## Cookie consent banner
## Shown at the bottom of every page until the visitor makes a choice. The
## preference panel slides in from the side when they open the settings.

## Notification bar

cookie-consent-notify-title = Help improve Common Voice
cookie-consent-notify-description = We use essential cookies to run this site. With your permission, we’d also use analytics cookies to learn how people use Common Voice.
cookie-consent-accept-all = Accept All
cookie-consent-reject-all = Reject All
# Link that opens the preference panel
cookie-consent-settings = Consent Settings

## Preference panel

cookie-consent-panel-title = Privacy Preference Center
cookie-consent-panel-intro = Choose which cookies Common Voice can use. Necessary cookies are always on because the site needs them to work. You can change your choice at any time from Cookie preferences in the footer.
cookie-consent-allow-all = Allow All
cookie-consent-necessary-title = Necessary Cookies
cookie-consent-necessary-description = These cookies make the site work, for example remembering your language and keeping you signed in. They can’t be switched off.
cookie-consent-analytics-label = Analytics Cookies
cookie-consent-analytics-description = These cookies help us count visits and see how people move around the site, so we can improve it.
cookie-consent-marketing-label = Marketing Cookies
cookie-consent-marketing-description = These cookies help us measure how well our campaigns work.
# Labels inside the on/off switch for each cookie category
cookie-consent-toggle-on = On
cookie-consent-toggle-off = Off
# Accessible name of the button that closes the banner or the panel
cookie-consent-close = Close
# Accessible name of the small button in the page corner that reopens the cookie settings
cookie-consent-corner-button = Set cookie preferences
# Accessible name of the cookie banner region, read by screen readers
cookie-consent-landmark = Cookie preferences

## Footer

# Button in the site footer that reopens the preference panel
cookie-consent-footer-link = Cookie preferences
